// Windows resources for WTEngine.exe.
//
// GLFW_ICON is the app icon. Explorer shows an exe's first icon, and GLFW
// gives its windows the icon resource with this name (title bar, taskbar,
// Alt+Tab) - so no code sets it. resources/make_icon.ps1 regenerates
// WTEngine.ico (all its sizes); -previewOnly draws a preview sheet instead.

GLFW_ICON ICON "WTEngine.ico"
